window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>Get the entire Bound by Dragons series in one book!</i></p> <p><b>I was born to ride dragons and no one can steal my fate...</b></p> <p>Tahlia is half-fae. Wrong blood. Wrong ancestors. Wrong everything.</p> <p>She’ll never be allowed to become a Mist Knight—a dragon riding warrior who defends the kingdom’s wild north coast.</p> <p>But when the noble female she squires for runs off with a barkeep, she decides to take the noble’s place, risk death by fire, and sneak into the tournament that will name the next Mist Knight.</p> <p>Full-blooded, noble, and second in command of the Mist Knights, Marius prides himself on living a strictly disciplined life. He has a plan: wed the commander's daughter and rise to his father-in-law's role, but only when the time is right.</p> <p>Marius never saw Tahlia coming…</p> <p>Tahlia is determined to burn her way into the Mist Knights' world and take that handsome Marius along for the ride.</p> <p><b>This omnibus version contains:</b></p> <p><i>Bound by Dragons</i> Book One</p> <p><i>Kingdom of Spirits</i> Book Two</p> <p><i>Crown and Dragon</i> Book Three</p> <p><i>Storm of Flames</i> Book Four</p> <p>Buy your copy today!</p>"; 
